v1.1:
  - Real I2C mode enabled by default (--simulate removed from service)
  - Calibration comments added in tank-sensor.conf (Osculati 27.161.15 sensor)
  - R_FULL=180 ohm, R_EMPTY=10 ohm (validated on hardware, April 2026)

v1.0:
  - Initial release
  - ADS1115 I2C ADC support (raw ioctl, no smbus dependency)
  - Resistive tank sender support (configurable R_EMPTY / R_FULL)
  - Voltage divider calculation with configurable R_REF
  - Sliding average smoothing
  - Simulation mode (--simulate) for testing without hardware
  - SetupHelper compatible (install/uninstall/reinstall)
  - Configurable via /data/dbus-tank-ads1115/tank-sensor.conf
